---

<MainLayout title="Yoyo | 数维杯数学建模竞赛">

<Navbar />

<section class="project-page">

<a class="back-link" href="/resume">← 返回简历 <span class="en">← Back to Resume</span></a>

<div class="hero">
<div class="hero-icon">📐</div>
<h1>
数维杯数学建模竞赛
<span class="en">Shuwei Cup Mathematical Modeling Competition</span>
</h1>
<p>
数学建模竞赛经历
<span class="en">Mathematical Modeling Competition Experience</span>
</p>
</div>

<section class="card">
<h2>
竞赛概述
<span class="en">Competition Overview</span>
</h2>
<p>
数维杯数学建模竞赛是一项面向大学生的数学建模竞赛，旨在考察参赛者运用数学方法解决实际问题的能力。竞赛要求参赛队伍在规定时间内完成问题分析、模型构建、算法实现与论文撰写。
<span class="en">The Shuwei Cup Mathematical Modeling Competition is a contest for college students, testing their ability to apply mathematical methods to solve real-world problems. Teams are required to complete problem analysis, model construction, algorithm implementation, and paper writing within a specified time.</span>
</p>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
竞赛内容
<span class="en">Competition Content</span>
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
问题分析与数学建模
<span class="en">Problem analysis and mathematical modeling</span>
</li>
<li>
算法设计与编程实现
<span class="en">Algorithm design and programming implementation</span>
</li>
<li>
数据处理与结果可视化
<span class="en">Data processing and result visualization</span>
</li>
<li>
建模论文撰写
<span class="en">Modeling paper writing</span>
</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section class="card">
<h2>
技术路线
<span class="en">Technical Approach</span>
</h2>
