<span>→</span>
<div>数学建模</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>算法实现</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>结果验证</div>
<span>→</span>
<div>论文撰写</div>
</div>
<div class="tags">
<span>Mathematical Modeling</span>
<span>Python</span>
<span>MATLAB</span>
<span>Data Analysis</span>
<span>Optimization</span>
</div>
</section>

